          "label": "A: T-S 12.600 recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">[...] I will ...\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] faithfully. Also she accepted [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...to be marrie]d to this David the kohen b. R. B[\u0101b]\u0101[d ...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] whose soul is at rest, 700 ful[l weight] zuz [...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] 400 full weight zuz, [and] 100 [...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] a strong, firm [d]ebt. And with this understanding [they] con[sent]ed [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[... which] she brought in from the house of her fathers: the upper story of his house [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] whose soul is at [res]t; a large upper story and that which is below [...]\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...]th whose soul is at rest, at 600 full weight zuz, and [...]\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] Their sum total is ni[ne]ty mithqals [and] 600 zuz. And these(?) are the art[icles...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] gold, muthallath cloth ... and seventy silver, and two pairs of\u2026</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] pairs... silver\u2014three mithqals ...\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] zuz and 3, and a pair ...\u2014twenty [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] 200 zu[z] and ...\u00a0 </li></ol>\n",
